  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through REDUCED INEQUALITIES in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">REDUCED INEQUALITIES will empower youth, with a special focus on young people with disabilities and young women (age 15-30), to secure financial stability. The youth will be provided with the necessary competence and capacity to access the national financial assistance funds. Furthermore, the youth will be mobilised into saving and investment groups, which will receive trainings on entrepreneurship and business skills.</narrative>
  </description>
